      "number": 1524,
      "body": "<!-- ccr-slack-attribution -->\n_Requested by **Matt Solomon** · [Slack thread](https://oplabs-pbc.slack.com/archives/C0BHEH8TG91/p1786397033387559)_\n\n## Summary\n\nReproduces https://github.com/futurealisha/superchain-ops/pull/2 here so this repo's CircleCI pipeline actually runs on it — the fork PR targets a branch in the fork and gets no CI. Change is authored by @futurealisha; credit belongs to them.\n\n**Task path**: `src/tasks/eth/rehearsals/2026-08-19-R2-remove-signer`\n\nThe commit SHA differs from the fork's because the fork isn't fetchable from this environment; the file contents are byte-identical (verified by sha256).\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_011Zz8GVdb1StFmBqVLSgjVh)_",
